  <item>
    <title>E54 从大厂裸辞变身海娜师的自由人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6addd8c6c96c8942ec11eb45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6addd8c6c96c8942ec11eb45</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 本期节目邀请到了海娜师JOJO，来为我们分享她的手艺人创业之路～</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgwLfUD4iOdIsy4ORmdQqDa4NzjU.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 海娜究竟是什么？海娜有什么寓意？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> JOJO作为曾经211出身的海外500强打工人，为什么选择了海娜师这一职业道路</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fked5uzmS9qRxwtINYJrVWCKWP7t.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 从踩坑创业再到正式入局海娜，正反馈是创业的核心！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 云南旅居边玩边赚钱，自驾云南53天深度旅居，摆摊总时长不到一周</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> JOJO带领徒弟拿“大结果”从快递分拣员，再到海娜师、实现收入心态双重蜕变</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 海娜师要对图腾和顾客的负责，未成年人接单需要家长知情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 敢做比做得好更重要，不要闭门苦练，要边做边迭代</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>手艺不能只靠热爱发电，海娜带来难得的「活人感」，真实大于完美。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 结尾的祝福，汪老师分享个人海娜体验，JOJO送上人生信条be real be brave，祝愿大家活出自我～</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlpiPX-VEEDkyBqalH3Eubw7pfKR.jpg"><p><span>香条体验的海娜太阳纹～非常好看且有一种原始的魅力！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/li39xFiu0GRwytxvPhDAHHZMgSXB.jpg"><p><span>思思和汪老师的爱情象征～（羊入虎口！）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6554355f89c369d3bfb4756c/lqtnUZCEc25cowuzNHfD8dBkKk4S.m4a" length="58885538" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlYzhOmTsjPdulgIyldMZDPCiZ0.png"/>
