  <item>
    <title>E53 原石水晶｜藏在矿石里的灵性大师</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5d9eb6a3fec224d5a03d7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5d9eb6a3fec224d5a03d7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 香条的原石水晶干货分享～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 原石水晶的优势：无打磨、能量保存更完整！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 个人捡漏经历：买黄泥骸骨，获赠带阿卡西线+浮生底+资料库的高价值白水晶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a> 涅槃水晶：涅槃重生寓意、天然形态、真假辨别、清理业力创伤用法</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs6SfVk2av0kKGy41IDNdNkm43b2.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 黄泥/红泥/白泥骸骨水晶：框架结构、内部包裹泥土、扎根地球能量、克服恐惧</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nqzIob_KSJX-4hecFqF8y9hn8icV.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">16:48</a> 传讯水晶/女神面等：晶体结构特征、跨维度传讯功能</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 缝合水晶（法登水晶）：地壳碎裂重组、乳白色缝合线，非常好的身体疗愈水晶</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsQs-JR0SJRbRpXgc-97Vs80m5qG.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 利姆利亚手术刀水晶：能量极强，谨慎使用～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> 资料库水晶：表面三角纹路、关于亚特兰蒂斯的古老记忆</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrVzfqoa9dOY0nNpBPk0OwCeQIOt.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a> 阿卡西线水晶：纹路特征、于阿卡西记录相关</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nveK10e33tnqXG_oX5kGks80MPiO.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a> 藤壶水晶：小晶依附大晶生长，拓宽思维、提升老灵魂智慧</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nnxuEJaZJhaQSTZS3vj1NzWLmyuV.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a> 时光隧道水晶：平行四边形纹路，左通过去右通未来，疗愈创伤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> 闪灵钻：双尖浮生底结构、高频顶轮水晶功效</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nm64aAgbKUgCf8rP2nk-G5T1qYUH.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">48:05</a> 钥匙孔水晶：寻找答案、突破内在限制性信念</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnIlzsPxI3wnnto6Du3iJEOXrcqA.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3106">51:46</a> 权杖水晶：下细上粗原石形态，提升自信气场、保护能量场</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nmK-8nonxQQBrrKBwyhNQX51ezb3.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">55:20</a> 原石水晶独特魅力：独一无二，单纯欣赏矿石之美也很治愈</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAmE1ta-FouK13kTzur8CKxYwYc.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a> 水晶结缘心态：不同阶段会吸引适配自己的水晶，不必在意他人评价</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ng0soJdvygd4gYCy9fvLv7bXz21k.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3795">1:03:15</a> 入门学习资源推荐：《能量水晶疗愈全书》、水晶信息卡等</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FntmrUJmlLrf9J3Ybu0y2jI0SEw5.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4180">1:09:40</a> 互动留言征集：评论区留下想听的玄学话题，后续随缘更新💗</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6554355f89c369d3bfb4756c/lr7Ci7Ta6cCLPgRwpSTkjpOOiMC7.m4a" length="34475239" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlYzhOmTsjPdulgIyldMZDPCiZ0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E52 茶中天地｜藏于茶里的东方智慧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1e5061ac7bdb080c3499d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1e5061ac7bdb080c3499d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><p><span>本期玄学少女研究部邀请拥有15年茶行业经验、从金融跨界做茶的陈老师</span></p><p><span>聊聊茶文化背后的历史、玄学与借茶修心</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuDcEbX7EUrKKIFJyTf1il6aZPY.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 金融人跨界做茶人：从为工作学茶到被茶改变人生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 喝茶15年的蜕变：告别亚健康，茶是最好的身体调节剂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 学茶的底层逻辑：有原则、没标准，泡茶的温度与出汤门道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 六大茶类各有妙用：黑茶祛湿燃脂、“金花”帮助肠道蠕动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 中医视角看茶：神农尝百草解毒，茶通经络、降火抗炎的千年智慧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 地域茶文化：潮州功夫茶、砂铫壶煮水，炭火阳火与电磁炉阴火的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 茶分阴阳：阳茶当年饮、阴茶越陈越香，藏着收敛与散发的养生之道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a> 茶与历史：茶马古道的战略意义，茶曾是中原与边疆的刚需物资</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 茶与情绪：茶氨酸安神静心，泡茶专注是最好的内观修行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 茶品见人品：偏爱黑茶、红茶、白茶，藏着性格与审美密码</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 茶修人生：从追名逐利到松弛通透，茶是治愈浮躁的东方解药</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 老祖宗的千年严选：琴茶香同源，传统文化都是修心的工具</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 喝茶即喝好风水：高山云雾出好茶，喝茶是吸收天地日月精华</span></p><p><span>愿大家以茶修心、平安康健，在茶汤里遇见松弛自在的生活～</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6554355f89c369d3bfb4756c/ltLrwQUWlNvaxVDiKlGGVlS8IisO.m4a" length="47218951" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlYzhOmTsjPdulgIyldMZDPCiZ0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E51恋爱脑必听！为什么你总遇到“消耗型伴侣”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a08694e1b7bd5029543d7b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a08694e1b7bd5029543d7b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 再一次邀请到周杰老师返场，探讨一下婚姻情感相关的问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 女性遇到“PUA”渣男要如何“防渣”，香条推荐一本书《反PUA话术清单》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 遇到不好的亲密关系，身体会不会给我们一些信号？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> “乖乖女”的情感选择，改变了她的人生轨迹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> “短剧”对于我们的爱情观造成的不好的影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 活在“情”字里的女孩，一辈子都为了感情而活</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 沟通的错位，理性男与感性女的情感表达偏差</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 周杰老师的感情和婚姻生活，爱情与婚姻生活的差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 真的有“灵魂伴侣”吗？很多时候是我们脑子里的“幻想”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a> 渣男给一些“糖衣炮弹”之后，会切断你的社交、隐形PUA、最后金钱索取</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 爱情中的边界感建立，要避免“失去自我”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4960">1:22:40</a> 原生家庭的影响，离婚的爸妈，吵架的家庭，造成恐惧婚姻～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5400">1:30:00</a> 受过高等教育却为了爱情放弃事业的女孩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5820">1:37:00</a> 压抑、失眠、生气、焦虑等躯体化症状都可能与有问题的情感关系有关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6060">1:41:00</a> 需要了解自己在关系里有什么模式，推荐《好情绪，好关系》课程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6430">1:47:10</a> 祝愿所有的听众朋友都能活出独立通透的情感状态～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6554355f89c369d3bfb4756c/llIF2yNwzpLn4GvNgGwcLry6w8wj.m4a" length="106899970" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:50:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlYzhOmTsjPdulgIyldMZDPCiZ0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E50 灵性电影清单｜帮你放下内耗、活在当下</title>
