  <item>
    <title>E44 点香招“飘”？线香实用指南来咯！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694101205e8cb26fdf15e539</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694101205e8cb26fdf15e539</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 美芝带着浓厚的感冒腔来分享她的线香体验啦，美芝的邪修通鼻法～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 美枝分享香格里拉之行收获，在当地非遗体验中心体验非遗线香制作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 藏香里有非常多的药材，原来好的线香是可以吃的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 为什么宗教里经常使用香来供神？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 关于燃香可以补充“气”，这里提到的书名《茶道经》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 从西医看药效分子能经鼻腔入体，从中医看可补宗气、通脉络、养精神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 点艾草、圣木等纯阳性香能驱阴暗处浊气、正气场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 重要内容之“点香招负能量”是误解，心念正就无需害怕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 关于点香的禁忌，什么地方不能点香呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 关于上香不要贪，以及为什么要上三支香？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> 关于点一支香是斗法的玄学故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 关于野庙，台阶数的奇数和偶数的区别～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1268">21:08</a> 香谱是什么？为什么能解读香燃烧的形态来判断空间能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> 供神的香根和香灰要怎么处理呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 选香以自己喜欢为主，沉香沉稳、檀香稳心神、藏香浓郁～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 关于点香招桃花和招财这种说法，我们如何看待～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 关于唐卡体验，真的请完唐卡就能暴富吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 香是工具， 香可以利益到我们，但是我们不能被工具左右</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> 点线香会不会产生PM2.5伤肺呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2451">40:51</a> 节目的最后推荐香格里拉非遗体验中心</span></p><span></span><p><span>地址在这里：香格里拉独克宗古城非遗体验中心</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lih8bemPWfk_PKKWGY5o9h9OuSvL.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6554355f89c369d3bfb4756c/lmq6js4E1jdGDwy2EKmWoGgk9R_R.m4a" length="44106044" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlYzhOmTsjPdulgIyldMZDPCiZ0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E43 塔罗到奇门｜东玄入门初体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f484bb22654730202d3796</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f484bb22654730202d3796</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 香条的东玄旅程从老家的青城山开始啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 奇门遁甲和塔罗牌其实都“很科学”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 俩玄学工具其实都靠观天象，打破“玄学=迷信”的刻板印象～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 奇门遁甲的“依通”——不用开强灵感WiFi，靠盘就能看懂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 东西玄对比，牌阵vs九宫格！奇门遁甲九宫像“祖传固定牌阵”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 实测案例来咯！香条打网球受伤🤕️，测妈妈打麻将赢钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 奇门加塔罗看未来男朋友的长相！真的差不多哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 奇门遁甲“一盘多用”太牛！老师用一个盘，既能看爱情也能看事业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 奇门遁甲看读书能力！小孩成绩如何也能看出来！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 奇门符号解读！测外面是否有情人～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> “丁”字既能代表小火苗，还能当“鱼钩”（钓资源）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 十二长生VS愚人之旅！都是人事物的一生，东西方玄学撞款了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3284">54:44</a> 这里提到的案例盘，大家可以参考看一下</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvtp5q893IBBT6gzvPx2IIiBeUZd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> 蛋黄未来男朋友的塔罗牌来咯～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fieq31gAK_6hPwcCKdE7xLxE_-sV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> 玄学收费很重要！哪怕1块也要收！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">77:00</a> 香条的玄学感悟小总结！好的命理师也是好的心理老师，要给人希望～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4740">79:00</a> 听友福利时间！满30条评论抽幸运观众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a> 祝大家天天开心，快乐的感受世界的美好～</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有神奇有趣的八卦玄学故事、欢迎投稿～</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家对《玄学少女研究部》的喜爱与关注！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>【进听友群】VX：Chantil78</span></p><span></span><p><span>【小红书】玄学少女研究部</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6554355f89c369d3bfb4756c/ltkB5Fqnxb5AJGGvTrjoxAkDL6PQ.m4a" length="77394768" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlYzhOmTsjPdulgIyldMZDPCiZ0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E42 从县衙狐仙到灵魂归家｜平遥玄游记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f36ddd456ffec65e60279b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f36ddd456ffec65e60279b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>玄学少女旅行部回归啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>玄学女孩不逛景点逛庙宇，平遥狂挖民间玄学故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听山西、成都的玄学灵感故事本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 玄学女孩的山西行是民俗文化与灵感采样游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 聊聊中元节后的平遥初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 平遥古城的风水布局传说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a>平遥县衙独特的行政、司法、神庙祭祀系统！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmf2hMOHXTzjKxBfNKMew1gwh9sh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> 藏在县衙后院的“守印大仙” 神权与王权的共治</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 二郎庙：从历史英雄到复合型神灵的演变</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqAM2IYBLPvRAySlwtKCMVbsKQi-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 香条逛青城山，传说青城山是阴阳交界的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 网络争议的《又见平遥》究竟是怎样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2591">43:11</a> 人死之后到底魂归何处、异乡灵魂如何归家？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 东北的萨满和道教的方式都是如何找到灵魂的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 香条分享给蛋黄的一段关于缘分的话～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJA7HwKcN1iGiig99Y1j_7RRKIv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3376">56:16</a> 机缘巧合下的西安之旅、缘分妙不可言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3630">60:30</a> 西安出租车师傅梦中的青蛇与白龙！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a> 下期预告：香条分享自己学习奇门遁甲的收获～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4290">71:30</a> 命运他会安排你去到最适合的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以命运安排你去哪里，你就大大方方的去～</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有关于平遥关于山西的有趣故事欢迎评论分享！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJDm8h6IrY8BvdZG9fVi8weD4oO.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqyZ6iH_EHUXIafXnSgd09KE47Gt.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp-XkGrVGF6nXm-6fznVdh9MdUBR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhy8Qmir5UkcyPlEgthFBR92KKF_.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6554355f89c369d3bfb4756c/lmUB56SdTm5JN1YHrvq0XGHiEiv4.m4a" length="62459180" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlYzhOmTsjPdulgIyldMZDPCiZ0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E41 片场“玄”学大赏：导演饭桌上流出的片场怪谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c24c922c82c9dccacdad71</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c24c922c82c9dccacdad71</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们、本期是片场的八卦玄学故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>特意为了夏日制作的纳凉特辑哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>郑重声明哈纯属八卦，切勿当真！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>友情提示本篇音质为现场实录较为真实粗犷</span></p><span></span><p><span>切勿耳机音量过大 &nbsp;音质追求党可以中途跳过</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是本篇shownote 诸君选自己感兴趣的收听：</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> &nbsp;僵尸片中的灵异八卦事件</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> &nbsp;片场行为禁忌与鬼片拍摄习俗揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> &nbsp;影视行业起名与八卦吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 无间道改名轶事与白龙王的神秘指引</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 片场导演们分享的灵异与超自然经历</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">21:42</a> 郭导的机房灵异素材&amp;横店秦王宫发电车奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a> 那些地下拍摄中的素材离奇丢失事件</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> 对寺庙体质过敏的离奇经历</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2019">33:39</a> 栋导日本拍摄期间经历的灵异事件</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">40:04</a> 深夜探访富士山下的ZS森林</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">42:57</a> 探访北京诡八楼&amp;日本灵异房产</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3296">54:56</a> 东北出马仙文化之“张三疯大战孙悟空”</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3733">01:02:13</a> 编剧老师的深夜奇遇 从公交怪谈到诡异房子</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4940">01:22:20</a> 香条的神秘纳凉故事分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有神奇有趣的八卦玄学故事、欢迎加入我们的【玄学小饭桌】</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家对《玄学少女研究部》的喜爱与关注！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>【进听友群】VX：Chantil78</span></p><span></span><p><span>【小红书】玄学少女研究部</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6554355f89c369d3bfb4756c/lqB-gDIZCbOY_7cZemjwysPV7Yda.m4a" length="76144012" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:30:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlYzhOmTsjPdulgIyldMZDPCiZ0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E40 重生之大师兄奇门遁甲改命记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ba92de97178f08ee6951f8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ba92de97178f08ee6951f8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><p><span>本期节目玄学少女研究部邀请到人称“大师兄”的奇门遁甲老师～</span></p><p><br></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fug54XGpumJYloWQEr8BlwCfbMsC.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 大师兄如何从国内最会玩的冲浪店老板到学习“玄学第一术”——奇门遁甲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 大师兄的老师回答对了什么问题，能让大师兄对奇门遁甲深信不疑？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 负债的同时还在学习，大师兄是如何想的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 奇门遁甲帮助大师兄规避了什么风险呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 为什么奇门遁甲是三术之首？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 为什么有一种说法“学会奇门遁，来人不用问”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 奇门遁甲能够改命吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 为什么有的人算命算多了，会有五弊三缺？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 如何判断“奇门遁甲”的人算的准与不准？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 人生风水是什么呢？奇门遁甲预测人生风水！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 奇门遁甲关于“飞天遁地”和“操控天气”的传说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> 民间有一种说法是“十个奇门九个疯”这是为什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 奇门遁甲普通人可以学吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 奇门遁甲可以单纯用数学验证吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 奇门遁甲很多人认为太难了，它真的很难吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 奇门遁甲公开课！想来的朋友请报名！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 奇门遁甲高级内容“运筹帷幄”的商业案例来咯～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">01:06:00</a> 奇门遁甲如何起局呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">01:08:00</a> 奇门遁甲能不能改善运势呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">01:10:00</a> 大师兄突发福利～解读蛋黄的“灵魂簇密码”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">01:20:00</a> 想邀请大师兄返场的朋友，请评论区留下足迹～</span></p><p><span>想要邀请大师兄返场参与活动被抽到的幸运儿</span></p><p><span>加微信Chantil78入听友群参与哦～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6554355f89c369d3bfb4756c/lrljnHUYIxdzPnNw0_l8tpCb1vRv.m4a" length="81812644" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:24:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlYzhOmTsjPdulgIyldMZDPCiZ0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
